## Compilar
```bash
mkdir build && cd build
cmake ..
make
```

## Ejecutar tests
```bash
cd build && ./tests
```

## Estructura
src/storage/   → DiskManager, Page, StorageManager
src/buffer/    → BufferPool, LRU
src/index/     → B+ Tree
src/query/     → Volcano Model, Join, Sort
tests/         → unit tests por módulo
docs/          → diagramas e informes